<http://data.silknow.org/object/2dbb0e81-81a3-37ba-914c-a7dcecd5caa6>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal thread.\nTwill binding.\nWarp: light red silk, Z twist.\nWeft: silk: black, light red, mauve, light green, dark green, all indeterminable twist and white silk S twist.\nMetal thread: silver strip open S-wound on yellow silk, S twist.\nMetal thread ground with incomplete pattern. What remains consists of two bands:\n[1] an oblong-shaped white petalled flower-head with light red centre and black outlines alternating with a slightly smaller and rounder version with pink petals outlined in white. The latter motif is enclosed within two pairs of white leaves outlined in black.\n[2] a flower with a red centre, mauve inner petals and red outer petals is surrounded by dark green leaves.  This alternates with a round flower with red centre and mauve petals or red centre and light green petals enclosed within white leaves [see band 1]."@en , "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal thread, Iran, 1800-1870"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/27d0d6fb-51b8-3c41-bfd1-8fd2fb139b6a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal thread, Iran, 1800-1870"@en , "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal thread.\nTwill binding.\nWarp: light red silk, Z twist.\nWeft: silk: black, light red, mauve, light green, dark green, all indeterminable twist and white silk S twist.\nMetal thread: silver strip open S-wound on yellow silk, S twist.\nMetal thread ground with incomplete pattern. What remains consists of two bands:\n[1] an oblong-shaped white petalled flower-head with light red centre and black outlines alternating with a slightly smaller and rounder version with pink petals outlined in white. The latter motif is enclosed within two pairs of white leaves outlined in black.\n[2] a flower with a red centre, mauve inner petals and red outer petals is surrounded by dark green leaves.  This alternates with a round flower with red centre and mauve petals or red centre and light green petals enclosed within white leaves [see band 1]."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/2dbb0e81-81a3-37ba-914c-a7dcecd5caa6/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2dbb0e81-81a3-37ba-914c-a7dcecd5caa6/dimension/1> ;
